{"id": "asian-pacific-islander-legal-outreach-award-controls", "title": "Why federal auditors questioned a $500,000 San Francisco legal aid grant", "seconds": 49.3, "voice": "elevenlabs:9PVP7ENhDskL0KYHAKtD", "narrator": "Jerry B.", "made": "2026-11-25", "key": "e6652d0b621c5d41", "words": 128, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "A federal audit questioned documentation for a grant.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 2.86, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["What", "supported", "the", "grant", "charges?"], "sub": "Federal award review"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.53, 0.81, 1.21, 2.0, 2.19, 2.26]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The organization drew all 500,000 dollars of one award.", "t0": 2.98, "t1": 6.19, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$500,000", "label": "Questioned costs on the drawn award"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.83, 1.09, 1.27, 1.54, 1.78, 2.15, 2.5, 2.63, 2.79]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "A separate 455,000 dollar award remained undrawn.", "t0": 6.31, "t1": 10.1, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit", "kicker": "U.S. Department of Justice, Office of the Inspector General", "text": "Separate award", "mark": "Separate award"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.6, 0.83, 1.12, 1.78, 2.19, 2.49, 2.88, 3.28]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Payroll was allocated using budgeted shares. Timesheets lacked grant-specific hours.", "t0": 10.22, "t1": 15.01, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit", "kicker": "U.S. Department of Justice, Office of the Inspector General", "text": "Payroll and subrecipient records", "mark": "Payroll and subrecipient records"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.37, 0.52, 1.08, 1.37, 1.77, 2.67, 3.33, 3.6, 4.35]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Auditors found approval or support problems in a test of 13 subrecipient invoices.", "t0": 15.13, "t1": 19.71, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "13 invoices"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.51, 0.79, 1.24, 1.35, 1.74, 2.16, 2.28, 2.36, 2.65, 2.77, 3.27, 3.96]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Auditors accepted documentation for 92 of the 203 victims reported in one period.", "t0": 19.83, "t1": 25.1, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "relationship", "context": "July–December 2014", "heading": "Victims served", "source": "audit", "rows": [{"icon": "file", "label": "Reported", "value": "203"}, {"icon": "audit", "label": "Accepted documentation", "value": "92"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.5, 0.98, 1.79, 1.97, 2.59, 2.71, 2.83, 3.06, 3.33, 3.58, 4.01, 4.46, 4.6, 4.81]}, {"scene": "scope", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[2]"], "text": "The nonprofit raised documentation and attorney-client confidentiality concerns.", "t0": 25.32, "t1": 29.72, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit", "kicker": "U.S. Department of Justice, Office of the Inspector General", "text": "Appendix 6", "mark": "Appendix 6"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.76, 1.0, 1.87, 2.1, 2.88, 3.78]}, {"scene": "scope", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[2]"], "text": "The auditors expressly said they made no finding of misspending.", "t0": 29.84, "t1": 33.03, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "No finding of misspending"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.61, 1.18, 1.45, 1.63, 1.88, 2.09, 2.51, 2.59]}, {"scene": "scope", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[3]"], "text": "The half-million-dollar recommendation appeared on the March 2019 open list.", "t0": 33.15, "t1": 37.23, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "march", "kicker": "U.S. Department of Justice, Office of the Inspector General", "text": "Recommendation register", "mark": "Recommendation register"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 1.04, 1.77, 2.13, 2.24, 2.37, 2.64, 2.94, 3.42, 3.7]}, {"scene": "scope", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[3]"], "text": "A subrecipient documentation recommendation still appeared in March 2023.", "t0": 37.35, "t1": 41.66, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Subrecipient records"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.85, 1.6, 2.38, 2.66, 3.03, 3.15, 3.4, 3.68]}, {"scene": "scope", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]"], "text": "The published lists do not establish how much was accepted, disallowed or repaid.", "t0": 41.78, "t1": 46.13, "shot": "r10", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Costs accepted", "Repayment"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.55, 0.82, 0.98, 1.17, 1.67, 1.87, 2.13, 2.27, 2.98, 3.62, 3.77]}, {"scene": "scope", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 46.25, "t1": 48.37, "shot": "r11", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.63, 0.79, 1.03, 1.11, 1.21, 1.47, 1.75]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "A federal legal assistance award", "scope": "What the audit concluded"}, "look": "dossier", "hook": "document"}